  "report": {
    "notes": "Last in the order. Two replicate runs. Aircraft from the inventory: 2 DJI Mavic 3 (T1, T2) and 5 Rotor Riot Tanq 5 inch (T3 to T7). Launch all from the NW end; T5 launches 20 s after the others. T3 and T4 cross the axis twice with 5 m of height separation; T6 and T7 fly 16 m apart; T1 and T2 line abreast 36 m apart. Every aircraft holds its own altitude. Review rule: an observation counts for an aircraft only when its bearing and time agree with that aircraft GCS log within the stated uncertainty; otherwise log it as a wrong association. Before the first run: synchronize the PC, camera and telemetry clocks, record the offset with a visible time-marked event, and keep the correction (plan section 7, step 3). Safety: every path stays inside the UAS Fly Area; no path points at the camera site or at GCS-1. The One-way attack aim point sits 60 m short of the cameras. Site datum: the profile origin is the centre of the UAS Fly Area file (lat 35.289972, lon -79.385599, WGS84). Ground elevation 150 m is a planning value; survey it.",
    "dataSources": [
      "Four camera recordings, RTSP main stream, continuous, native resolution, 25 fps, MP4 segments with timestamps",
      "Camera configuration snapshot per run per camera (Appendix B.1 JSON): resolution, fps, FOV, zoom, focus, exposure, time offset",
      "Camera survey record: WGS84 position, lens height, azimuth, tilt, roll, installation photo",
      "Aircraft GCS telemetry log at the maximum rate: GPS time, latitude, longitude, altitude, accuracy",
      "ATOS tag track for the same aircraft (VAL fused), for comparison with the GCS log",
      "Clock synchronization record: PC, camera, video and telemetry offsets with the measured uncertainty",
      "Detection event table per camera: first possible, first confirmed, first identified; frame index, UTC, still image, reviewer",
      "Computed ranges per event: aircraft and camera ENU positions, ground range, slant range, uncertainty, FOV-limited and occluded flags",
      "Environmental record per run: sun position, sky background, cloud, visibility, wind, obstructions",
      "Target-absent recording interval per run (120 s before launch) for the false-detection count",
      "Association table per camera: observation, aircraft assigned, bearing and time residual against the GCS log, wrong-association flag",
      "Missed-observation list per aircraft per camera"
    ],
